[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1947431858","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2390#issuecomment-1947431858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2390","id":1947431858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850E3Oy","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T22:19:38Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T22:19:38Z","body":"I'm not sure this is really a specific license exception as the total of this LICENSE file seems to be to explain the licensing overview of the project and where things might be differently licensed or how to request a different license.\r\n\r\nI think the bit you quote is referring to https://github.com/asterisk/libpri and files in that part. That exception is on the SPDX License List at https://spdx.org/licenses/libpri-OpenH323-exception.html\r\nsee https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1939 and related issue at https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1971\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1947431858/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962364440","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2390#issuecomment-1962364440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2390","id":1962364440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850904Y","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-24T13:29:01Z","updated_at":"2024-03-21T17:29:58Z","body":"This is another case for https://github.com/spdx/change-proposal/blob/main/proposals/Modifiers.md since SPDX do not support modifiers other than exceptions. I agree that the case here is not an exception as usual. Exceptions usually relief from obligations. Here we have a grant of additional permissions.\r\n\r\nOur engine resolves the text as follows: \r\nLicense: [GNU General Public License 2.0](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/%5Bg%5D/README.md#user-content-gnu-general-public-license-2.0) (with [Asterisk Linking Permission](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/%5Ba%5D/README.md#user-content-asterisk-linking-permission))\r\nMarker: Trademark Marker, Authors View Marker\r\n\r\nThe Authors View Marker is added due to the section\r\n\r\n> It is our belief that applications using these protocols to manage or control an \r\n> Asterisk instance do not have to be licensed under the GPL or a compatible license\r\n\r\nI'm trying to convince the SPDX team for a long time now to open the modifiers to not only include exceptions, but without success. So for the time being you will have to represent the license as \r\n\r\nGPL-2.0-only AND LicenseRef-Asterisk-Linking-Permission\r\n\r\nwhere the LicenseRef represents the additional grant text. This is also how we would represent our scanner identification in an SPDX document (which may be seen as imprecise).\r\n\r\nBtw: https://spdx.org/licenses/Asterisk-exception.html is also not an exception in the classical sense. It's a sublicensing modifier.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962364440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2005751358","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2390#issuecomment-2005751358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2390","id":2005751358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE853jVY-","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c